{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15174","headline":"送归中丞使新罗册立吊祭 · 李益","name":"送归中丞使新罗册立吊祭","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"东望扶桑日，何年是到时。\n片帆通雨露，积水隔华夷。\n浩渺风来远，虚明鸟去迟。\n长波静云月，孤岛宿旌旗。\n别叶传秋意，回潮动客思。\n沧溟无旧路，何处问前期。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李益","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_15174.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15174","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}